\id COL  
\h Kurutsetari 
\toc2 Kurutsetari 
\toc1 Kurutsetari kemɨtiwarunɨ'airi Papuru 
\toc3 Kur 
\mt1 Kurutsetari  
\mt2 Kemɨtiwarunɨ'airi Papuru  
\c 1  
\s1 Waɨritsika  
\p
\v 1 Ne Papuru, ta'iwa Timuteu matɨa, tekanixewaɨritɨaka, nɨ'ariekame nekanihɨkɨtɨni Kɨritsitu Ketsutsi hetsiemieme, mɨpaɨ mɨtinakekɨ Kakaɨyari,   
\b  
\p
\v 2 tekanixewaɨritɨaka ta'iwama yuri xemɨte'erie kurutsetari, Kakaɨyari teɨterimama xemɨhɨkɨ Kɨritsitu hetsie xetewiyatɨ, 'ipaɨ teputiyuane:  
\b  
\p Kakaɨyari mɨta'ukiyari Tati'aitɨwame Ketsutsi Kɨritsitu matɨa 'aixɨa mekete'u'iyarini xehetsiemieme, mekexepitɨaka yu'iyaritsie xemɨka'uximatɨariekakɨ.   
\s1 Kemɨtitawawiri Kakaɨyari, mɨwapitɨanikɨ memɨtemaikakɨ 'Iyaritsie timieme  
\p
\v 3 Tetanenewietɨ, taheyemekɨ xehepaɨtsita pamɨpariyutsi tekanipitɨaka Kakaɨyari, Tati'aitɨwame Ketsutsi Kɨritsitu 'ukiyarieya,  
\v 4 tekatenimarieka yuri kexemɨte'erie Kɨritsitu Ketsutsi hetsie, kexemɨtewanaki'erie Kakaɨyari teɨterimama yunaime,  
\v 5 mɨpaɨ xekateniyurieka 'amuwekɨ tita xehetsiemieme mɨti'ɨwiyarie taheima, yaxete'ikwewietɨ. Xeme meripai xekaniu'enanani kemɨti'ɨwiyarie, kuxaxatsiwakaku niuki 'aixɨa manuyɨne kemɨtiyuri,  
\v 6 mɨkɨ niuki xehetsɨapaitɨ kaninuani. Naitsarie kwiepa katinitixuawerirɨmeni, kanitawerirɨmeni yaxeikɨa kemɨtiuyɨ xehetsɨa, niuki kaniutsutɨarieni 'iya tukaritsie kepauka xemu'enana, kepauka xemɨtehetima yurikɨ 'aixɨa kemɨtiuka'iyari Kakaɨyari.  
\v 7 'Epapɨraxi kemɨtixe'uta'ɨkitɨa, mɨkɨ tahepaɨ katini'uximayatametɨni, tekaninaki'erieka, yakatinikamieni Kɨritsitu parewiwameya hɨkɨtɨtɨ xehetsiemieme.  
\v 8 Mɨkɨ katatiniutaxatɨani kexemɨteyukanaki'erie 'Iyaritsie xetewiyatɨ.   
\p
\v 9 Yatetehetimaika 'anapaitɨ hikɨke, tame 'ayumieme tepɨkatehayewa tetanenewietɨ xehetsiemieme, mɨpaɨ tete'iwawirietɨ Kakaɨyari, xemɨhɨpɨnenikɨ yaxetemaitɨ tita mɨtinake Kakaɨyari, naimekɨ xetemaiwawetɨ, 'Iyaritsie timieme xetemaitɨ naimekɨ,  
\v 10 'axemu'uwanikɨ meta kemɨreuyewetse Ti'aitame hetsɨa miemete kememɨte'u'uwa, xe'inaki'atsitɨatɨ naimekɨ. Tepiwawirie mɨtiutixuxuawerenikɨ 'aixɨa xeteyuriekaku naimekɨ, xemɨtiwawerirɨmenikɨ kexemɨte'imate Kakaɨyari.  
\v 11 Tepiwawirie xemɨtɨrɨkariyarienikɨ, naimekɨ xetɨrɨkawitɨ, 'iya kemɨtitɨrɨkaɨye mariwetɨ, para xemɨyɨwawenikɨ xemɨte'uka'eniwanikɨ, xemɨte'ukanenewiekakɨ naime hepaɨtsita,  
\v 12 xeyutemamawietɨ pamɨpariyutsi xemipitɨakakɨ ta'ukiyari. Mɨkɨ yɨwemete katanayeitɨani, tahetsie mɨtinakenikɨ tita Kakaɨyari teɨterimama wahetsie mɨtinakeni hekɨaripa memu'uwa.  
\v 13 Kataniutawikweitsitɨani Kakaɨyari, yɨriya heitserie mɨkahexeiyanikɨ tahepaɨtsita. Kataniupata, kemɨ'ane mɨnaki'erie tati'aitɨwame mayanikɨ, nu'ayatɨtɨ.  
\v 14 Mɨkɨtsie tetewiyatɨ tekaniuxɨnarieni, kemɨtareuyehɨwiri 'axatemɨte'uyurikɨ.   
\s1 Kɨritsitu mumɨkɨ, ketemɨte'upitɨarie 'aixɨa temɨtexeiyarienikɨ  
\q1
\v 15 Tepɨkayɨwawe temixeiyakɨ Kakaɨyari, peru mɨkɨ kani'ɨkitsikayatɨni,  
\q2 kanimexɨakametɨni heitserie hexeiyatɨ tita mɨtiunetɨarie hepaɨtsita.   
\q1
\v 16 Hetsiena tiwiyatɨ, naitɨ katiniunetɨarieni,  
\q2 tita taheima mɨtimieme, tita kwiepa mɨtimieme, tita temɨtexeiya, tita temɨkatexeiya,  
\q2 meta mamariwawemete, mɨkɨ memɨtɨrɨkawi, te'aitamete, mɨkɨ heitserie memexeiya:  
\q1 mɨkɨ naitɨ katiniunetɨarieni  
\q2 'iya 'inetɨaku, hetsiena mieme tiniunetɨarienita.   
\q1
\v 17 Mɨkɨ 'akaniuyeikakaitɨni tixaɨtɨ katinetɨariewekaku 'akuxi,  
\q2 naitɨ katiniyuxewini mɨkɨtsie tiwiyatɨ.   
\q1
\v 18 Mɨkɨ kanitamu'utɨni, tewi waiyarieya hepaɨ te'anenekaku,  
\q2 tame temɨtatixexeɨriwa.  
\q1 Titsutɨwame hɨkɨtɨtɨ,  
\q2 mɨkɨ mɨkite memanuku'uni wamexɨakame kanihɨkɨtɨni,  
\q2 naimekɨ mexɨakame mayanikɨ.   
\q1
\v 19 Kakaɨyari kemɨtiyuwaɨriya, naitɨ ke'anetɨ mɨhɨkɨ Kakaɨyari, mɨkɨ Kɨritsitu hetsie 'akaniuweni.   
\q2
\v 20 Mɨpaɨta katiniuyuwaɨriya, naime 'aixɨa mɨtiyurienikɨ Kɨritsitu yatiyurienekaku, para naitɨ 'aixɨa mɨtixeiyarienikɨ mɨkɨ kemɨtixeiya,  
\q1 kuruxitsie yuxuriya kemɨtiutayeuri,  
\q2 pipitɨa tita kwiepa mɨtimieme tita taheima mɨtimieme hamatɨana 'aixɨa memɨteyuxeiyanikɨ.   
\p
\v 21 Xemeta 'ana paitɨ xepɨyupatakai xaɨtsie miemete xe'ayuyeitɨatɨ, kexemɨteyɨkɨhɨawekai, xekani'uxiwe'eriekaitɨni mexi 'axaxeteyuriekai.  
\v 22 Hikɨrixɨa 'aixɨa xetexeiyarietɨ xekanayeitɨarieni, mɨkɨ tewitɨtɨ yuwaiyaritsie mumɨkɨ, mɨpaɨ katiniuyurieni mɨxe'aye'atɨanikɨ Kakaɨyari hɨxie, hetsiena mieme xepatsiekaku, 'aixɨa xe'anenekaku, xehetsie karahɨiwakaku.  
\v 23 Mɨpaɨ katiniyɨmɨkɨ xɨkate xeyuhayewa yuri xete'erietɨ, xetetsariya tɨrɨkaɨyekaku xehetɨa, xetseiriyarietɨ xekakuyuaximetɨ, matsi xe'ikwewietɨ tita mɨtixata niuki 'aixɨa manuyɨne. Xekani'enieni mɨkɨ niuki, kanihekɨatsieka naitsarie kemɨranetɨarie muyuawi hetɨa, ne Papuru nekaniuhɨritɨarieni hepaɨtsitana.   
\s1 Papuru kemɨtiuhɨritɨarie nuiwarite wahetsiemieme  
\p
\v 24 Hikɨtsɨari ne nekaninetemawieka tsepa nemu'uximatɨarie xehetsiemieme, nekaneye'atɨani tita mɨreuyewetse nemu'uximatɨariekakɨ, Kɨritsitu kemɨtiu'uximatɨarie, newaiyaritsie mɨpaɨ nekatiniyurieneni mɨkɨ waiyarieyatsie mieme, memɨyutixexeɨriwa mehɨkɨtɨkaku.  
\v 25 Ne waparewiwame nekanayani, Kakaɨyari kemɨnetiuhɨritɨa xehetsiemieme, 'aye'arɨkamekɨ nemikuxatanikɨ Kakaɨyari niukieya,  
\v 26 mɨkɨ niuki kani'awietsiekaitɨni, tukari manukatɨatsie pɨkamatsiɨkɨkai, teɨteri kepauka memanutikɨ mɨpaɨ mepɨkatemaikai, matsi hikɨ matsiɨkɨtɨ kanayani, Kakaɨyari teɨterimama mɨpaɨ memɨtemaikakɨ.  
\v 27 Kakaɨyari kaniuyuwaɨriya mɨpaɨ mɨtiwa'ɨkitɨanikɨ mɨkɨ, waɨkawamekɨ witsikemɨti'ane 'ikɨ niuki mɨ'awietsiekai, kemɨtimariwe nuiwarite watsata. Kɨritsitu xehetsie katiniwiyani, 'ayumieme xekanikwewieka witsimɨti'ane, mɨkɨ kanihɨkɨtɨni niuki mɨ'awietsiekai.   
\p
\v 28 Tame tekanihekɨatani Kɨritsitu, ketemɨtewaku'imaiya yunaime teɨteri, ketemɨtewa'ɨkitɨa yunaime teɨteri tetemaiwawetɨ naimekɨ, temɨwaraye'atɨanikɨ yunaime teɨteri me'aye'arɨkame Kɨritsitu hetsie metewiyame.  
\v 29 'Ayumieme netinine'uxitɨaka, yemekɨ neti'uximayatɨ, 'iya tɨrɨkaɨyemekɨ kemɨnetikuyuitɨwa.   
\c 2  
\p
\v 1 Kaneuyeweka xemɨtemaikakɨ waɨkawa kenemɨtine'uxitɨa xehetsiemieme, rautitseyatari wahetsiemieme meta, hipameta keyupaɨmetɨ memɨkanetsixeiyawawe wahetsiemieme.  
\v 2 Wa'iyari mɨtuikarienikɨ, memɨyutaxewirekɨ meyunaki'erietɨ, memeuka'unikɨ yemekɨ yametemaitɨ kemɨtiheitserie, memeitimanikɨ tita Kakaɨyari mɨti'awietakai, mɨkɨ Kɨritsitu kanihɨkɨtɨniri,  
\v 3 hetsiena mɨti'awietsiekɨ naitɨ kemɨreukawe Kakaɨyari, mɨtimaiwenikɨ mɨ'ayumieme meta mɨtiuyemaikakɨ.  
\v 4 'Ipaɨ nepaine, xewitɨ mɨkatixe'irɨwiyanikɨ witsitiuniutɨ xeikɨa.  
\v 5 Tsepa newaiyaritsie xehetsɨa nemɨka'uyeika, ne'iyaritsie pɨta xehetsɨa nekaniuyeikani nenetemawietɨ, nexexeiyatɨ 'aixɨa xete'aitɨariekame, xetsetse'ime yuri xete'erietɨ Kɨritsitu hetsie.   
\s1 Kɨritsitu hetsie kemɨtiuxɨnarieni  
\p
\v 6 'Ayumieme, Ketsutsi kexemɨte'utanaki'eri Kɨritsitu Ti'aitame tɨme, yaxeikɨa hetsiena xetewiyatɨ 'axekeneu'uwani.  
\v 7 Hetsiena xeketenewiyani kɨye kemɨtiwiya yunanayaritsie, kii kemɨtiwiya tetsariyatsie, heitseriemekɨ xekenetseiriyarieka yuri xete'erietɨ, xemɨte'u'ɨkitɨarie hepaɨ, pamɨpariyutsi xekenepitɨaka Kakaɨyari.   
\p
\v 8 Xekeneyukweriwayurieka kapa xewitɨ xe'unawanikɨ, timaiweme hepaɨ tikuxatatɨ, yakɨ xeikɨa tixe'irɨwiyatɨ teɨteri wayeiyarikɨ, hekwamekɨ kwiepa memɨtama kememɨte'ɨkitɨarie, peru Kɨritsitu kemaine katikuxatatɨ.   
\p
\v 9 Mɨkɨ waiyarieyatsie 'akaniuweni naitɨ ke'anetɨ mɨhɨkɨ Kakaɨyari.  
\v 10 Xemeta hetsiena xetewiyatɨ xekanaye'atɨarieni, yunaitɨ memɨte'aita heitserie memexeiya kaniwamu'utɨni.  
\v 11 Hetsiena xetewiyatɨ xekaniu'inɨaritɨarieni mɨyatɨniketɨ, peru mamá kemɨtiyuxiteke pɨkatixaɨ, Kɨritsitu pɨta kemɨtixe'u'inɨaritɨa, kanixe'upitɨani xemɨtehayewakɨ yaxeteyurietɨ teɨteri wawaiyari kemɨtiwakuyuitɨwa.  
\v 12 Xeme xepu'inɨaritɨarie kepauka xemuka'ɨyarie hamatɨana xemukateukie. Mɨkɨ meta, kepauka xemuka'ɨyarie, xekananuku'uitɨarieni yuri xete'erietɨ Kakaɨyari tɨrɨkariyayatsie, yaxeikɨa kemɨrenukuketɨa Kɨritsitu mɨkite watsata.   
\p
\v 13 Tsepa xemɨmɨkitetɨkai xeheuyexɨrɨwetɨ xeka'inɨaritɨariewawetɨ kexemɨteteɨteri, mɨkɨ kanixe'anutanieritɨani Kɨritsitu mame, katatineuyehɨwirieni naime ketemɨteheuyexɨrɨwekai.  
\v 14 Ketemɨte'ataka'utɨa yakɨtɨtɨ 'aitɨarikatsie yatemɨtekahunikɨ, mɨkɨ 'utɨarika hixɨapa 'uwetɨ kemɨtatika'unakekai, Kɨritsitu kaneyeitɨani heihurieka yakɨtɨtɨ, yukuruxitsie 'ikɨrapuximaka.  
\v 15 'Ixuriki mɨye'i hepaɨ kaniwarewiwieni mɨkɨ memɨte'aita heitserie memexeiya, wahekɨatɨatɨ yunaime wahɨxie, kuruxitsie 'uyewietɨ, kaniwarehapani yu'utɨma, wara'iwaka.   
\p
\v 16 Xewitɨ 'ayumieme pɨkaxexanetani tita xemɨtekwa'akɨ meta tita xemɨte'iekɨ, xemiwewiekɨ 'ixɨarari, yatɨni metsa mɨhekwa 'ixɨarariyari, yatɨni 'uxipiya tukari kexemɨkate'iwewiekɨ.  
\v 17 Mɨkɨ tita 'umɨramie 'etɨriyaya katinihɨkɨtɨni, peru kemɨ'ane 'umamie, Kɨritsitu kanihɨkɨtɨni.  
\v 18 Xewitɨ pɨkaxetawe'erieka, tsepa 'iya mɨyuwaɨriya tixaɨtɨ karayuyeitɨatɨ, tsepa mɨyuwaɨriya mɨwarayexeiyanikɨ Kakaɨyari niuki tuayametemama, tsepa waɨkawa mɨyu'iyaritɨa yuheinɨtsi hepaɨtsita. Kemɨ'ane mɨya mɨ'ane kaniyuta'ɨreni, tita waiyarieyatsie mɨtimieme xeikɨa kana'eriwani,  
\v 19 tamu'utsie katiwiyatɨ. Peru mɨkɨ tamu'utɨtɨ kanihɨkɨtɨni kemɨ'ane mɨtimikwa yuwaiyari, turuyarikɨ tatayarikɨ kanitaxewiriyani yuwaiyari mɨtawerekɨ, Kakaɨyari kemɨtiweriya.   
\p
\v 20 Merikɨte, Kɨritsitu matɨa xɨka xe'ukwini, para tawari xemɨkakuyuitɨarienikɨ hehekwamete kwiepa memɨtama kememɨte'ɨkitɨarie, ¿titayari 'aumɨ 'axete'u'uwa kwiepa memɨtama kememɨtexe'aitɨa:  
\v 21 «Tixaɨ pepɨka'ikumaɨwani 'ikɨ, pepɨka'ikwaka 'iya, pepɨka'imayɨani 'ikɨ»?  
\v 22 Mɨkɨ 'aitsikate naitɨ teɨteri kememɨte'aita kememɨte'ɨkita kanihɨkɨtɨni, mɨkɨ naitɨ katinitixɨmɨkɨ tikumayɨiwatɨ.  
\v 23 Kememɨteyurie, timaiweme niukieya hepaɨ katini'eniɨriɨkɨni, kememɨteyumaiwe'erie, tiku'itawatɨ tixaɨtɨ mɨkarayuyeitɨa, karima kememiyurie yuwaiyari. Peru kememɨteyurie, tixaɨtɨ pɨkatiyunaki'erie wai tita mɨreuhiwe'erie hepaɨtsita.   
\c 3  
\s1 'Aitsikate patsietɨ muyeikanikɨ  
\p
\v 1 Xɨka Kɨritsitu matɨa xe'anuku'uitɨarieni, taheima timiemekɨ xekeneyuwaɨriyani, hakewa meka Kɨritsitu, Kakaɨyari tserieta 'akaitɨ.  
\v 2 Taheima timiemekɨ xekeneyu'iyaritɨaka, kwiepa timiemekɨ pɨkatixaɨ.  
\v 3 Xeme xekaniukwiniri, kexemɨte'ayeneniere, xekani'awietsieka Kɨritsitu hamatɨa, Kakaɨyari hetsie xemɨtewiyakɨ.  
\v 4 Kɨritsitu kanitatukaritɨni, kepauka matsiɨkɨtɨ mayani, 'anata xeme hamatɨana xematsiɨkɨtɨ xekanakɨnikuni witsimɨraku'anetsie.   
\p
\v 5 'Ayumieme mɨkite xekenayuyeitɨaka kexemɨtekumaɨwakai yuwaiyaritsie kwiepa timiemekɨ: xepɨka'ikumaɨwani kemɨ'ane mɨkaxe'ɨya mɨkaxekɨna, xepɨkateyukahiwe'erieka, xepɨkatehiwe'erieka tita 'aixɨa mɨkati'anene, tita mɨkatixepini, kemɨ'ane mɨtihiwe'erie tita mɨkatipinieya tetexi muwarayexeiya hepaɨ kaniyɨanemɨkɨ.  
\v 6 Mɨpaɨ memɨteyuriekɨ, 'ayumieme Kakaɨyari haxɨa kaniwapitɨamɨkɨ mɨkɨ yamemɨkatekahu.  
\v 7 Xemeri kepauka mɨpaɨ xeteyurietɨ 'axemu'uwakai 'anapaitɨ, yaxeikɨa xekateniyuriekaitɨni kememɨte'u'uwa.  
\v 8 Peru hikɨ matsi xeketeneuhayewa 'ikɨta naime: kexemɨteyuka'uxiwe'eriekai, kexemɨteyuhaxɨatɨakai, 'axakexemɨteyuriekukai, 'axakexemutiyuanekai hipame wahepaɨtsita, niuki 'axamanuyɨne kexemɨtexɨatɨakai yutetakɨ.  
\v 9 Xepɨkateyu'itaiyani, xekenehɨwa mɨkɨ tewi mɨye'i, xekahe'eriwatɨ kexemɨteyuriekai meripaitɨ.  
\v 10 Mɨhekwa pɨta xekenanakatɨki, xehekwariyarieximetɨ yemekɨ kexemɨteyurie hikɨ, xemimaikakɨ Kakaɨyari, mɨxe'utawewi hepaɨ xe'anenetɨ xemakɨnekɨ.  
\v 11 'Iyatsie tiwiyatɨ tsepanetɨ mɨkɨriyeku, mɨhuriyu, tsepa mu'inɨatsie huriyutsixi waxitekiyakɨ, tsepa mɨka'u'inɨatsie, tsepa 'ateewa kiekatari, tsepa waɨriyarika mɨti'uximaya, tsepa mɨyunɨ'a, Kɨritsitu naitɨ kanihɨkɨtɨni, yunaime wahetsie katiniwiyani.   
\p
\v 12 'Ayumieme nepaine, Kakaɨyari mɨxe'anuyexeikɨ, teɨterimama xemɨhɨkɨkɨ, xemɨnaki'eriwakɨ, xeteyukanenimayatɨ xekenakɨni yu'iyaritsie, mɨhekwa xe'anakatɨtɨ, 'aixɨa xeketeneu'iyarini, xepɨkateyukatawe'erieka, xeketeneuyukanaki'erieka meta 'axeketeneutewini xekaha'atɨ.  
\v 13 Xekeneyunewieka, xeketeneuyuyehɨwirieka xɨka xewitɨ 'itaniukimani xeime. Ti'aitame kemɨtixeheuyehɨwiri, xemeta hepaɨna xekeneyɨaka.  
\v 14 Xe'ixewiriyatɨ naime, xeketeneyukanaki'erieka, mɨkɨ kanihɨkɨtɨni xemuyuxewiriyanikɨ mɨ'ayumieme.   
\p
\v 15 Kɨritsitu kemɨtixepitɨa yu'iyaritsie xemɨka'uximatɨariekakɨ, ketixe'aitɨaka xe'iyaritsie, xekaniuta'inierieni yu'iyaritsie xemɨka'uximatɨariekakɨ, xeiwaiyari xemɨhɨkɨkɨ. Mɨkɨ meta, pamɨpariyutsi teyupitɨwamete xekenakɨni.  
\v 16 Kɨritsitu niukieya xehetsie keheyekani waɨkawa, naimekɨ xetemaiwawekaku: Mɨkɨkɨ xeketeneyɨ'ɨkitɨaka meta xekeneyutuikani, Kakaɨyari kwikarieyakɨ, nɨawari Kakaɨyari hepaɨtsita manuyɨnekɨ, kwikari 'Iyaritsie timieme hepaɨtsita manuyɨnekɨ xeteyɨkɨhɨawetɨ, xekeneutikwikani, yu'iyaritsie xe'inɨawatɨ Kakaɨyari, pamɨpariyutsi xe'ipitɨatɨ.  
\v 17 Naime tsepa tita xemɨteyurie, tsepa xemutiniuka tsepa xemɨtekumaɨwa, naime xeketeneyurieka Ti'aitame Ketsutsi hetsɨa xemiemetetɨtɨ, mɨkɨ xeparewiekaku, pamɨpariyutsi xekenepitɨaka Kakaɨyari mɨta'ukiyari.   
\s1 'Aitsikate yuri memɨte'erie wahetsiemieme  
\p
\v 18 'Ukari xekeniwareu'enieka yɨkɨnama, kemɨreuyewetse Ti'aitame hetsie xetewiyatɨ.  
\v 19 'Ukitsi meta, xekeniwanaki'erieka yɨ'ɨitama, 'axaxepɨkatewakɨhɨaweni.  
\v 20 Tɨɨri meta, yaxeketenekahuni naime kememɨtexekɨhɨawe xepaapama, mɨpaɨ pɨreuyewetse, mɨpaɨ xeteyuriekaku kaninaki'aka Ti'aitame.   
\p
\v 21 Xeme meta xemɨwapaapama, xepɨkawahaxɨatɨaka yuniwema, kapa me'utiwaɨripienikɨ.  
\v 22 Xeme waɨriyarika te'uximayatamete, yaxeketenekahuni naime kememɨtexe'aitɨa xekutsiyarima kwiepa memɨtama. Wahɨxie xeikɨa yaxepɨkateyurieka xewanaki'atsitɨanike teɨteri, 'aixɨa 'iyarikɨ pɨta xeketene'uximayaka Ti'aitame xe'ayemakatɨ.  
\v 23 Tsepa tita xemɨteyurie, yu'iyarikɨ yaxeketeneyurieka Ti'aitame hetsiemieme, teɨteri wahetsiemieme pɨkatixaɨ,  
\v 24 mɨpaɨ xetemaitɨ Ti'aitame pɨxetipitɨani tita xehetsie mɨtinakenikɨ. Xeme Kɨritsitu hetsiemieme xekateni'uximayaka Ti'aitame.  
\v 25 Kemɨ'ane 'axamɨtiuyuri mɨkɨ 'axamɨti'anekɨ katinakapitɨariemɨkɨ kemɨtiuyuri, Kakaɨyari yɨkɨ pɨkatiwaxeiya yunaime teɨteri.   
\c 4  
\p
\v 1 Xemeta xemɨwakutsiyarima, kemɨtiheitserie xeketeniwapitɨaka te'uximayatamete, yaxeikɨa xewayurietɨ, mɨpaɨ xetemaitɨ, xemeta taheima xemeixeiyakɨ yukutsiyari.   
\s1 Hipatɨ tawarita 'aitsikate  
\p
\v 2 Xepɨkatehayewani xeyunenewietɨ: nenewierikɨ xekenayeneniereni, pamɨpariyutsi xe'ipitɨatɨ.  
\v 3 Kepauka xemɨyunenewie, tahetsiemiemeta xekeneyunenewieka, Kakaɨyari kitenie mɨreuyepienikɨ tahetsiemieme, niuki temɨkuxatanikɨ, tita mɨti'awietsiekai Kɨritsitu hepaɨtsita temɨtekuxatanikɨ, mɨpaɨ nemɨtiyurienekɨ nepanutahɨiya hikɨ.  
\v 4 Xekeneyunenewieka nemihekɨatanikɨ tita mɨti'awietsiekai, kemɨreuyewetse yanemɨtikuxatanikɨ.   
\p
\v 5 Xetemaiwawetɨ xekeneyɨaka yuri memɨkate'erie xewakɨhɨawetɨ, kepauka xemɨyɨwawe 'aixɨa xemɨteyurienikɨ, yemekɨ mɨpaɨ xeketeneuyuri.  
\v 6 Kexemɨtekuxata, 'aixɨa xete'u'iyaritɨ xeketenekuxatani 'aixɨa ha'anemekɨ, xeniuki kahamurimekɨ. 'Ana mɨpaɨ xepɨyɨwaweni kehepaɨ 'aixɨa mɨyɨni xemɨwata'eiyakɨ yuxexuime.   
\s1 Waɨritsika kemɨtiwarunɨ'airiexɨa  
\p
\v 7 Naime kenemɨtiuyuri katinixetaxatɨamɨkɨ Tikiku, mɨkɨ kanita'iwatɨni teminaki'erie, tiparewiwame yamɨtikamie kanihɨkɨtɨni, tahepaɨ katini'uximayaka Ti'aitame hetsiemieme.  
\v 8 Xemɨtemaikakɨ tahepaɨtsita, xe'iyari mutuikarienikɨ, 'ayumieme nekanenunɨ'amɨkɨ xehetsɨa,  
\v 9 'Unetsimu mame, mɨkɨta kanita'iwatɨni teminaki'erie, yakatinikamieni, xehetsɨa miemetɨtɨ. 'Ena kemɨtiyɨane naime mekatenixetaxatɨakuni.   
\p
\v 10 Kanixewaɨritɨaka 'Aritsitariku nehepaɨ muwiyarie, Marikuxi Werunawe 'iwaya yatewa pɨxewaɨritɨa. Xepɨte'aitɨarie hepaɨtsitana, xɨka xehetsɨa nuani, xekeneutanaki'eri.  
\v 11 Ketsutsi meta Kutsitu mɨtitewa kanixewaɨritɨaka, huriyutsixi watsata 'ikɨ xeikɨa nehamatɨa mekateni'uximayaka Kakaɨyari 'ena ti'aitatɨ mayanikɨ, mekaneninɨtɨaka nemɨnewaɨriyanikɨ mɨkɨ.  
\v 12 'Epapɨraxi xehetsɨa mɨmieme kanixewaɨritɨaka, Kɨritsitu Ketsutsi hetsiemieme ti'uximayatɨ, yuheyemekɨ xehetsiemieme katiniyu'uxitɨaka yunenewietɨ, mɨpaɨ 'utaitɨ, xemɨkakuyuitɨarienikɨ xe'aye'atɨ, yemekɨ xeyuwaɨriyatɨ naimekɨ kemɨtinake Kakaɨyari.  
\v 13 Nekanihekɨatanikeyu ka'uxetɨ kemɨti'uximaya xehetsiemieme, rautitseyatari wahetsiemieme meta hierapuritari wahetsiemieme.  
\v 14 Rukaxi kanixewaɨritɨaka tiyu'uayemawame neminaki'erie, Remaxi meta pɨxewaɨritɨa.  
\v 15 Xekeniwawaɨritɨaka 'iwamarixi rautitseyatari, metatsiere Nimɨpatsi meta mɨkɨ memɨyutixexeɨriwa kiitana yunaime.   
\p
\v 16 Kepauka 'ikɨ xapa mɨtiterɨwarieni xehɨxie, xekeniwaruhuritɨa rautitseyatari memɨyutixexeɨriwa mɨkɨta memititerɨwanikɨ, meta xeme Rautitseya mieme xapa xekeneutiterɨwa.   
\p
\v 17 'Ipaɨ xeketeneutahɨawi 'Arukipu, kene'akweriwayurieka pemeye'atɨanikɨ 'ahɨritɨarika, kepemɨtiuhɨritɨarie Ti'aitame hetsie petiwiyatɨ.   
\p
\v 18 Ne Papuru nemamakɨ neti'utɨatɨ nekanixewaɨritɨaka. Xekenena'eriwani kenemɨranutahɨiya. 'Aixɨa ketiuka'iyarini xehetsiemieme.   